ement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Gross margin of 83.2% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/cgi-bin/browse-edgar?action=getcompany&CIK=0001774675"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $96.6m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1774675/000143774926019986/0001437749-26-019986-index.htm","accession":"0001437749-26-019986"}],"bear":[{"text":"Revenue fell 4.7% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025). Whatever the story is, it is not currently showing up in sales.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1774675/000143774926019986/0001437749-26-019986-index.htm","accession":"0001437749-26-019986"},{"text":"The company is loss-making at the operating line (-8.8% margin). Profitability is a forecast, not a fact.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1774675/000143774926019986/0001437749-26-019986-index.htm","accession":"0001437749-26-019986"},{"text":"Diluted share count rose 23.5% over the year (Q3 2022 vs Q3 2021). The company can grow while your share of it shrinks, and this is the number most commentary ignores.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1774675/000155837022018490/0001558370-22-018490-index.htm","accession":"0001558370-22-018490"},{"text":"Shareholders' equity is negative (-$72.8m) - liabilities exceed assets on the balance sheet.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1774675/000143774926019986/0001437749-26-019986-index.htm","accession":"0001437749-26-019986"},{"text":"Officers and directors hold only 0.3% of the shares. There is little alignment between what happens to the share price and what happens to them.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1774675/000109148226000010/0001091482-26-000010-index.h